            "target_entity_instance": "UMMISCO",
            "target_entity_type": "Institute",
            "paragraph": "The model was implemented in Gama, an individual modeling platform developed at UMMISCO that enabled us to integrate all the processes listed in the conceptual model. We called the obtained informatic simulation tool \u201clolly\u201d, which is the name of one of the fishing seasons in Lebu, the main historic fisher community in Dakar. We used the computing capabilities of UMMISCO in Dakar to explore this model, in particular the effect of fishing unit efficiency and climate scenarios.",
